Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start the process by identifying the vacancy") -> action(n2,"Is there a suitable candidate available") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> converge(c1) -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n6,"advertise the vacancy again") -> converge(c2) -> action(n7,"select the appropriate applicant") -> action(n8,"appoint the candidate") -> action(n9,"process ends") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n1,"start the process by identifying the vacancy") -> action(n2,"Is there a suitable candidate available") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> converge(c1) -> branch(b2,XOR) -> converge(c2) -> action(n7,"select the appropriate applicant") -> action(n8,"appoint the candidate") -> action(n9,"process ends") -> end(e1)